* TOPX -- tsu BBS topics list. Model 2 (24x80).
*
* Deviations from 3270BBS   (all forcd by bricks):
*   - separator is 78 asterisks, not 79 (col 79 stays untouched to
*     dodge the wrap-to-next-row bug; see bookm2.map)
*   - F11 point-and-sort, F5=Add Topic and per-column sort markers
*     dropped (read-only browser, F10 toggle only)
*   - tsu's 'Found: n' overlay at search col 31 collides with the
*     STOP byte; folded into ERRMSG       instead
*
MAP TOPL2 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD LTITLE AT 0,0   LEN 58 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=DEFAULT
  FIELD LPAGE  AT 0,60  LEN 9  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD HDRS   AT 1,0   LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "S"
